<title>HONG KONG: China/Hong Kong Dec air cargo by carrier and airpo.</title>
<headline>China/Hong Kong Dec air cargo by carrier and airpo.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo traffic between Hong Kong and China in December continued to be dominated by cargo flows to and from Beijing and Shanghai with Air China and Dragonair the principal carriers, statistics published by the Hong Kong Aviation Department show.</p>
<p>Imports and exports including  transhipment cargo in December and November 1996 by airline with amounts in tonnes included:</p>
